### Сценарии за ръчна проверка на API (IntelliJ HTTP Client; същите заявки могат да се пуснат и през Postman)

### Създаване на заявка
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ivan Petrov",
  "customerEmail": "ivan@example.com",
  "description": "Broken boiler",
  "serviceType": "REPAIR",
  "executionMode": "ON_SITE",
  "priority": "URGENT",
  "address": "Varna, 1 Main St",
  "urgencyReason": "No heating"
}

### Всички заявки
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests

### Заявка по id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1

### Несъществуваща заявка -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/requests/999

### Невалиден email -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ivan Petrov",
  "customerEmail": "not-an-email",
  "description": "Broken boiler",
  "serviceType": "REPAIR",
  "executionMode": "REMOTE",
  "priority": "STANDARD"
}

### ON_SITE без адрес -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ivan Petrov",
  "customerEmail": "ivan@example.com",
  "description": "Broken boiler",
  "serviceType": "REPAIR",
  "executionMode": "ON_SITE",
  "priority": "STANDARD"
}

### URGENT без причина -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ivan Petrov",
  "customerEmail": "ivan@example.com",
  "description": "Broken boiler",
  "serviceType": "REPAIR",
  "executionMode": "REMOTE",
  "priority": "URGENT"
}

### Невалидна enum стойност -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Ivan Petrov",
  "customerEmail": "ivan@example.com",
  "description": "Broken boiler",
  "serviceType": "PAINTING",
  "executionMode": "REMOTE",
  "priority": "STANDARD"
}

### Започване на обработка (SUBMITTED -> PROCESSING; повторно -> 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/start-processing

### Отхвърляне (PROCESSING -> REJECTED; друг статус -> 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Outside of our service area"
}

### Отхвърляне с празна причина -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": ""
}

### Оферта (само за PROCESSING заявка -> OFFERED; цената се изчислява)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/offer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Replace the heating element and test the boiler"
}
